        "role": "close",
        "subject": "A raised view from the dock leveller back into the bay where every pad is taped in lit gold-orange on dark tiled epoxy. A kit worker in a hard hat and hi-vis vest stands at left with a long shadow, red oxide columns and a roof truss receding into black.",
        "visual_consequence": "Every pad is gold, against half on frame 5 and one on the cover, and the floor still holds no machines. At 432 px the all-gold grid, the worker and the shadow read at once.",
